  "limitations": [
    "Step API executes the fixedGreedy policy;candidate probes can mutate state on rejection. No generic external action executor,certified legalmask,action features or atomicrollback. Blocking pending choices is intentional;100finished episodes are bounded equivalence evidence.",
    "Decisionbinary contains fixedLeft value observations/outcome labels,not action labels/rewards/masks or an RL policy trajectory. Samplingmodes have different distributions;downstream models still need explicit sampling-distribution binding.",
    "Choicepolicy is first-index/v1,synchronous. Inline/singleton/zerooffer paths may bypass hooks;async choice andfull metadata/visibility contracts remain open.",
    "Driver catches ordinary exceptions and rejects the episode;OutOfMemory is not swallowed. Errors are checked when control returns to driver,not guaranteed immediate interruption inside every legacy callback. Exception-partial state is diagnostic only,not a resumable transaction.",
    "Gate2 adds error andmetadata consistency checks;legacyGate1 remains readable without inventing missing counters. JSON/data hashes are provenance/integrity checks,not a signed security boundary or rule fidelity proof.",
    "No new game-rule/card certification. ThreehistoricalQueenOwnlong seeds remain unfinished regression seeds;not rerun as a new1000gameclaim.100samplebaseline andone-epochvaluefit do not establish strength,encoding quality or global audit completion."
  ],
